#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:301
msgid ""
"Requests require a logged-in WordPress user. Omit user_id to use the "
"current user's data, or pass user_id to target another account when the "
"caller can edit that user (edit_user capability). Unauthenticated requests "
"return fc_api_forbidden. An invalid user_id returns fc_api_user_not_found."
msgstr ""
"Eskaerek WordPress erabiltzaile saioa hasita behar dute. Uneko "
"erabiltzailearen datuak erabiltzeko, ez erabili user_id, edo beste kontu "
"bat helburu gisa erabili deitzaileak erabiltzaile hori edita dezakeenean "
"(edit_user gaitasuna). Autentifikatu gabeko eskaerek fc_api_forbidden "
"itzultzen dute. Baliogabeko user_id batek fc_api_user_not_found itzultzen "
"du."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:316
msgid "HTTP 200 with { \"data\": { ... } } when the handler returns a payload."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 200 { &quot;data&quot;: { ... } }-rekin kudeatzaileak karga bat "
"itzultzen duenean."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:317
msgid ""
"HTTP 200 with { \"success\": true } when there is no payload (for example "
"DELETE)."
msgstr ""
"HTTP 200 { &quot;success&quot;: true } balioarekin, kargarik ez dagoenean "
"(adibidez, DELETE)."

#: inc/rest-api/documentation.php:318
msgid ""
"Failures return WordPress REST error JSON from WP_Error (code, message, "
"data.status). Wire codes use the fc_api_* prefix."
msgstr ""
"Hutsegiteek WordPress REST errore JSON itzultzen dute WP_Error-etik (kodea, "
"mezua, data.status). Wire kodeek fc_api_* aurrizkia erabiltzen dute."

